{
 "duration": 25.19,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Your warmest jacket is the reason you're freezing on winter hikes.",
   "start": 0.25,
   "end": 4.022
  },
  {
   "text": "You start in one big puffy coat.",
   "start": 4.322,
   "end": 6.114
  },
  {
   "text": "On the climb, you sweat right through it.",
   "start": 6.314,
   "end": 8.228
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the wind hits that wet shirt, and you're done.",
   "start": 8.428,
   "end": 10.722
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix is thin layers. Base, fleece, shell. Keep the puffy in your pack for stops.",
   "start": 11.072,
   "end": 16.132
  },
  {
   "text": "Warm and dry, the whole way up.",
   "start": 16.432,
   "end": 18.295
  },
  {
   "text": "The Winter Hiking Guide shows what to wear at every temperature.",
   "start": 18.695,
   "end": 22.167
  },
  {
   "text": "Get it at, hike supply co, dot com.",
   "start": 22.367,
   "end": 24.89
  }
 ],
